@startuml data-flow-sequence
title End-to-end data flow, as a sequence\nfrom Synthea to the analytics dashboard
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #475569
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  ParticipantBorderColor #64748B
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}

participant "Synthea" as SY
participant "FHIR R4 bundles" as FHIR
participant "Neo4j graph" as NEO
participant "OMOP CDM layer" as OMOP
participant "Analytics dashboard" as AN

SY -> FHIR : generate synthetic patients
FHIR -> NEO : load_fhir_neo4j.py\nPatient, Encounter, Condition, Observation,\nMedicationRequest, Procedure
NEO -> NEO : create the FHIR nodes\nand relationships (layer 3)
NEO -> OMOP : fhir-to-omop-transform.cypher
note over NEO, OMOP
  MAPPED_TO relationships:
  Patient to OMOPPerson, Encounter to OMOPVisitOccurrence,
  Condition to OMOPConditionOccurrence, and so on
end note
OMOP -> OMOP : CODED_BY to SNOMED, LOINC, RxNorm\n(copied from the FHIR node)
OMOP -> AN : cohort analytics queries\n(neo4j-proxy, /omop/cohort)
AN -> AN : render dashboards and charts
@enduml
